</math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["30"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["30"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="30"><mn>30</mn>
