ly <math alttext=\"0.3873\"><mn>0.3873</mn>\n</math> square meters per minute. Of the given choices, <math alttext=\"0.39\"><mn>0.39</mn>\n</math> is closest to <math alttext=\"0.3873\"><mn>0.3873</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"3a321846-3dc0-4a6d-82e6-2cfcf81ef623","correct_answer":["A"]},"createDate":1743430554981,"updateDate":1743430554981}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554981, 1743430554981),
    ($SATQ$7d68096f$SATQ$, $SATQ$86e6dfb4-d2c8-45de-afe3-b133ed0d88a5$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$438d2407-07b6-47b8-a393-17d52aedc2a6$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.G.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Evaluating statistical claims: Observational studies and experiments $SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 7, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p>A trivia tournament organizer wanted to study the relationship between the number of points a team scores in a trivia round and the number of hours that a team practices each week. For the study, the organizer selected <math alttext="55"><mn>55</mn>
</math> teams at random from all trivia teams in a certain tournament. The table displays the information for the <math alttext="40"><mn>40</mn>
</math> teams in the sample that practiced for at least <math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
</math> hours per week.</p>
<figure class="table"><table border="1">
<thead>
<tr style="height: 22.3906px;">
<th style="text-align: center; height: 22.3906px; width: 25.0771%;" rowspan="2" scope="colgroup">Hours practiced</th>
<th style="width: 75.2312%; text-align: center; height: 22.3906px;" colspan="3" scope="colgroup">Number of points per round</th>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 44.7812px;">
<th style="width: 25.0771%; text-align: center; height: 44.7812px;" scope="col">6 to 13 points</th>
<th style="width: 25.0771%; text-align: center; height: 44.7812px;" scope="col">14 or more points</th>
<th style="width: 25.0771%; text-align: center; height: 44.7812px;" scope="col">Total</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 22.3906px;">
